  <file id="dialogs\characters\ch_coltrane.txt" original="dialogs\characters\ch_coltrane.txt">
    <unit id="=&gt;q1" name="=&gt;q1">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">2</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::You come up to a rangy-looking ferryman loading some boxes into what is presumably his own ferry. He wipes the sweat from his forehead with the back of his hand and smiles, all the while rubbing that same sweat onto the back of his pants. He addresses you in a raspy baritone voice.::

Greetings, $(#laddie/lassie), I be Cap'n Coltrane, 'n' I got lots of interestin' tales to tell to those who sail with me, aye, for I'd seen things ye wouldn't believe.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q2" name="=&gt;q2">
