    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Now, matey, let me tell ye a story 'bout th' nastiest, foulest grog I've ever tasted in me life. Yarr. It be seventeen weeks ago, in a crummy bar in a settlement overlookin' th' dark waters o' North Underrail. It all began when a drunk Protectorate soldier approached me 'n' said "Ahoy, matey, how ye be doin'?"...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
