      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q46" name="=&gt;q46">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">92</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I don't sail thar, $(#laddie/lassie), for it be too risky. Strong currents 'n' island devils make that place... very undesirable.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a47" name="=&gt;a47">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">94</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>But I really need to go there.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q48" name="=&gt;q48">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">96</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source> Ye can try swimmin'. ::He laughs.:: Thar was 'tis lad a few years back...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a49" name="=&gt;a49">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">98</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I am not going to swim there. And I'm not interested in the story about the lad.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q50" name="=&gt;q50">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">100</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Aye, aye... I can see with me sharp eye yer getting mighty upset. Wanna sail somewhere else, though?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a51" name="=&gt;a51">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">102</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>What about the lad?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q52" name="=&gt;q52">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">104</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>'E tried swimin'.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a53" name="=&gt;a53">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">106</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>And?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q54" name="=&gt;q54">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">108</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>'E got eaten by chompers, aye.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a55" name="=&gt;a55">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">110</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Comforting.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q56" name="=&gt;q56">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">112</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Even if 'e hadn't, 'e'd never have overcome the strong currents surroundin' the island, aye. It'd have thrashed 'im around like a three-sheets-to-the-wind landlubber would thrash a cutlass while fightin' off a colony of sea bats. Aye.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a57" name="=&gt;a57">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">114</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Let us change the subject.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q58" name="=&gt;q58">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">116</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Aye?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a59" name="=&gt;a59">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">118</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I have something more important to do right now. See ya.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q60" name="=&gt;q60">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">120</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Aye. Farewell, $(#laddie/lassie).&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a61" name="=&gt;a61">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">122</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I see. I'd like to go somewhere else, please.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q62" name="=&gt;q62">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">124</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Aye?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a63" name="=&gt;a63">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">126</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Whatever. If you won't take me I'll find someone else.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q64" name="=&gt;q64">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">128</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::He laughs out loud.:: Good luck, matey.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a65" name="=&gt;a65">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">130</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Do you know anything about the Black Sea?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q66" name="=&gt;q66">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">132</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Aye, th' Hell's Gut. It be north of here 'n' east of Dreadpool. It be a place of danger 'n' mystery, aye. Pirates - bloodthirsty, filthy 'n' deadly - be livin' thar. I've never sailed thar, nor have I been near it, for it's not only pirates who should be feared... but other things.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a67" name="=&gt;a67">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">134</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>What other things?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q68" name="=&gt;q68">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">136</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Thar be creatures that rarely venture into our waters. Water serpents so large 'n' toxic they could easily capsize yer ferry, or sink it by meltin' 'er with their acid spit. It happened to old salt Cap'n Bebop, the jazz o' th' South Underrail waters, 'cause 'e got too near th' Hell's Gut. Aye. Some say it be pirate chemical weapons, but us ferrymen know better.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q69" name="=&gt;q69">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">138</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Thar be other things as well: giant crabs, giant bats that suck yer blood 'n'... bright-blue spirits, like orbs o' light, that sometimes haunt those who be sailin' near th' Black Sea, aye. 'N' those who come *too* near, th' Glowing Canine can make 'em go derailed. 

That's why th' pirates are hidin' thar, for no sane man would be lookin' for 'em in...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q70" name="=&gt;q70">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">140</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>The Hell's Gut. Yarr.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a71" name="=&gt;a71">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">142</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>How do I sail to...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q72" name="=&gt;q72">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">144</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Aye?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q73" name="=&gt;q73">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">146</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a74" name="=&gt;a74">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">148</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Core City?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q75" name="=&gt;q75">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">150</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Th' speediest way to reach it would be to sail north thru th' Dreadpool, aye, then west till th' Rig, then north from thar.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q76" name="=&gt;q76">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">152</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>But th' pirates be infestin' th' Dreadpool, so I'd instead suggest ye head south then west thru th' Meatway, then head north till ye smell th' nauseatin' reek of Core City's port.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q77" name="=&gt;q77">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">154</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>south then west thru th' Meatway, then head north past SGS 'n' Junkyard until ye can smell th' nauseatin' reek of Core City's port.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q78" name="=&gt;q78">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">156</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Alternatively, ye could go &lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a79" name="=&gt;a79">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">158</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>South Gate Station?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q80" name="=&gt;q80">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">160</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Head south till ye can turn west thru th' Meatway. Follow it 'n' ye'll find yerself in th' Chancer's Bay, 'n' from there just head north.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q81" name="=&gt;q81">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">162</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>SGS is on th' eastern side o' th' bay.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q82" name="=&gt;q82">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">164</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Junkyard's on th' western side o' th' bay.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a83" name="=&gt;a83">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">166</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Junkyard?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a84" name="=&gt;a84">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">168</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Never mind.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q85" name="=&gt;q85">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">170</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I won't, yarr!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a86" name="=&gt;a86">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">172</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I'd like to ask you something else.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q87" name="=&gt;q87">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">174</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Aye.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a88" name="=&gt;a88">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">176</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>You talk... differently.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q89" name="=&gt;q89">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">178</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Yarr, I don't dig what ye be meanin', $(#laddie/lassie)?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a90" name="=&gt;a90">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">180</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>That. "Yarr", "ye be" and all that. Where are you from?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q91" name="=&gt;q91">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">182</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Oh, 'tis just th' way I talk. Aye. ::He laughs.:: I be from afar, sailed 'ere from the shiverin', salty southern waters where slick iridescent eels 'n' giant black urchins be livin'. Thar, all th' folks be talkin' like 'tis. Me lake-dog of a father, rest 'is salty soul, 'e be speakin' in such thick accent not even mother or us, 'is sons, could understand a word o' what 'e was utterin'.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a92" name="=&gt;a92">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">184</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>And what is this place called?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q93" name="=&gt;q93">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">186</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Jade Harbor. It be way down south, far away from where ye 'n' I be right now. It be a place o' joy, mystery, adventure, 'n' spooky things. I could tell ye stories that'll shiver yer timbers right outta yer trousers. I could tell ye one or two - or three if th' right opportunity be, th' next time ye happen to hop into me ferry, aye.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a94" name="=&gt;a94">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">188</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Can you tell me one now?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q95" name="=&gt;q95">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">190</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>No. I got things to do. Got boxes to load in. Engine to check, aye. But if ye will hop into me ferry, then that be a different story. ::He laughs.:: Then we'll have th' time.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a96" name="=&gt;a96">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">192</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::[Intelligence][Persuade]:: I don't think that's how you naturally speak at all. I think it's all some kind of an act to draw customers in. Am I right?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q97" name="=&gt;q97">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">194</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Blimey! I already explained it to ye: I shout like 'tis 'cause that's th' way folks be talkin' in Jade Harbor. Now, if ye don't believe th' words from me mouth, well, thar's nothin' else I can do to sink yer opinion, matey. I be tellin' ye th' truth. &lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q98" name="=&gt;q98">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">196</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Th' truth 'n'... 'n' nothin' but th' truth. Aye.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a99" name="=&gt;a99">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">198</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Come on, I won't tell anyone. Besides, I could... send some people your way. Recommend you.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q100" name="=&gt;q100">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">200</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::He remains silent.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a101" name="=&gt;a101">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">202</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Come on now.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q102" name="=&gt;q102">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">204</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::The man furtively checks whether anybody else is too close to the two of you. He leans closer and whispers in a voice that has now sunk a few semitones lower, that no longer rasps the ear or bears the weight of theatrics.::

Look, $(#man/sister), you're crampin' my style. Yes, you got it, I get more customers if I do the act and tell them all the funny stories, okay? People like that kind of stuff. Do you know how hard it is to compete with the big fish like Cap'n Svana or Rastko, hmm? A man's gotta stand out somehow, especially if my ferry ain't as fast or spacious as theirs.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q103" name="=&gt;q103">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">206</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I ain't doin' anything bad, okay. There's nothin' wrong with it if the people enjoy it.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a104" name="=&gt;a104">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">208</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>But where did you learn to talk like that?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q105" name="=&gt;q105">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">210</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>My granddad used to tell me these old world stories about pirates. ::He nods.:: Back then, you see, the word pirate used to mean "sea merchant." Yeah. And, well, these wealthy and noble pirates would trade with various ships, or other pirates, right there on the sea, and their lives were full of adventure and drama and fightin' with sea beasts and giant pentapuses with eight tentacles. The word pirate nowadays means something completely different - ain't got a clue how that came to be - but I liked those stories. So after startin' my business and havin' people avoid me like the plague... I started doin' this thing.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q106" name="=&gt;q106">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">212</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>The Core City tourists loved it, I remember - loved it. Then other folks started diggin' it, and yeah, I've been doin' it ever since. It secured me my fair share of customers. I make up most of the stories now, but I still use the ones I remembered. The way I speak, that's pretty much how granddad delivered it, how he impersonated those old world pirates. Hell, I don't even know what words like "timber" mean, but I suppose I don't even need to. No one asked me what it meant. Ever.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q107" name="=&gt;q107">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">214</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Now please, I got kids to feed, so... ::He clears his throat.:: ...don't ye be crampin' me privateerin', $(#laddie/lassie), as they used to shout. Yarr, scurvy dogs o' th' sea.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
